WEBVTT

00:15.014 --> 00:16.074
Thanks for the food.

00:16.074 --> 00:17.084
That was fast.

00:17.084 --> 00:19.574
Yeah. I have to go already.

00:21.614 --> 00:22.814
See you when you get back.

00:23.924 --> 00:25.544
Yeah. See you later.

00:45.704 --> 00:49.744
Oh! Please don't forget about the
limited-time sale on eggs, okay?

00:49.744 --> 00:50.614
Okay.

01:04.464 --> 01:05.754
Coming!

01:06.264 --> 01:07.324
That was fast!

01:10.664 --> 01:11.994
Who the heck are you?

01:12.564 --> 01:14.364
This is lokawa's house, right?

01:14.834 --> 01:19.464
Look, is there a girl named lokawa here?
She's the younger sister of the family.

01:19.704 --> 01:24.014
U-um, she's staying at a relative's.

01:24.014 --> 01:27.504
Where?! Tell me where her relative's house is!

01:28.884 --> 01:30.454
You can tell me that much, right?

01:30.454 --> 01:32.014
W-well...

01:38.224 --> 01:41.424
Something reached for but cannot be grasped...

01:42.934 --> 01:46.424
Something that strays from that hand,
going far away...

01:48.104 --> 01:52.504
People will always pursue such things.

01:53.414 --> 01:56.774
And before long, become lost.

02:02.884 --> 02:07.324
This is our story of one such summer.

02:25.644 --> 02:27.074
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

02:27.074 --> 02:30.744
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow
Asphalt ni saita

02:30.744 --> 02:31.214
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

02:31.514 --> 02:35.174
Kodomo no rakugaki ga

02:35.954 --> 02:39.584
Kagerou ni yurarete

02:40.424 --> 02:43.254
Arukidashita

02:43.394 --> 02:48.234
Daremo shiranai yakusoku no

02:48.234 --> 02:51.864
Oka de meguriau

02:52.404 --> 02:57.104
Tatta ichido no kyou to iu

02:57.104 --> 03:01.874
Kiseki no toki wo kanjite

03:01.874 --> 03:06.044
Nagareru kumo oikakete

03:06.044 --> 03:10.384
Imanimo tsukamesou na

03:10.384 --> 03:14.754
Mune no yokan takanari

03:14.754 --> 03:19.384
Ugokihajimeta unmei

03:19.494 --> 03:23.864
Me ga sameru hodo mabushii

03:23.864 --> 03:27.894
Asa no hi yorimo atatakai

03:28.134 --> 03:32.044
Owari no nai kagayaku

03:32.374 --> 03:39.674
Hikari no kisetsu ni dakarete

03:42.084 --> 03:46.184
Summer's Eternity

03:55.764 --> 03:58.494
Sheeit! She didn't know a frickin' thing!

04:29.034 --> 04:31.024
Kanocho
Park

04:52.954 --> 04:55.444
Look, is there a girl named lokawa here?

04:56.154 --> 04:57.954
Tell me where her relative's house is!

05:02.464 --> 05:03.764
Huh?

05:27.854 --> 05:29.844
Whaddya think you're doin'?

05:33.124 --> 05:35.094
Well? What do you want with me?

05:35.094 --> 05:38.494
U-um, well...

05:39.334 --> 05:41.094
What are you doing?

05:42.504 --> 05:43.874
I told you before, right?!

05:43.874 --> 05:49.974
B-but, I said she's... at a relative's house...

05:52.744 --> 05:54.554
Well, it's just that...

05:54.554 --> 06:00.784
I sort of get the feeling that lokawa's
still here in this town.

06:03.664 --> 06:08.394
I can't exactly be sure, but I've got
a gut feeling... Is that the word?

06:08.764 --> 06:10.284
An animal instinct!

06:12.004 --> 06:13.024
Okay!

06:31.854 --> 06:33.544
Why are you following me?

06:43.804 --> 06:45.424
What's your problem?

06:45.534 --> 06:47.564
...by a guardian.

06:47.874 --> 06:48.674
Huh?

06:48.674 --> 06:51.794
Think of it as being accompanied by a guardian!

06:52.274 --> 06:53.934
The heck does that mean?

07:09.094 --> 07:10.954
852 yen, please.

07:14.834 --> 07:16.624
Let's see, what else?

07:16.764 --> 07:18.194
Hey, excuse me!

07:18.964 --> 07:19.594
Yes?

07:21.304 --> 07:22.294
Huh?

07:25.104 --> 07:28.714
Thanks! I'd been looking for a mailbox
but couldn't find one.

07:28.714 --> 07:30.174
So that was a letter?

07:30.174 --> 07:34.054
Yeah, to my father. I always write to him.

07:34.054 --> 07:35.784
You don't call?

07:35.784 --> 07:37.344
I'm good with just a letter.

07:39.884 --> 07:42.524
By the way, have you made any friends?

07:42.524 --> 07:43.194
Huh?

07:43.194 --> 07:45.324
You know, friends you can play with and stuff.

07:45.324 --> 07:47.094
Uh, yes.

07:54.334 --> 07:56.324
Two coffees, please.

07:56.674 --> 07:57.794
Coming up!

08:04.784 --> 08:06.714
No running
in the hallway
Always be
cheerful
and polite.

08:13.454 --> 08:15.354
This is our classroom.

08:16.224 --> 08:18.214
And that's lokawa's desk.

08:19.824 --> 08:24.354
She's pretty short, so sometimes
she can't see the board from her desk.

08:28.234 --> 08:29.494
I see.

08:35.344 --> 08:36.534
Now look...

08:37.714 --> 08:40.234
She wouldn't be hiding in THERE, would she?

08:40.584 --> 08:42.914
Just how small do you think she is?

08:42.914 --> 08:45.314
I guess you're right.

08:47.054 --> 08:49.254
IOKAWA

09:08.244 --> 09:10.174
Do you want to search that room, too?

09:10.744 --> 09:13.074
No, it's not that.

09:14.214 --> 09:17.384
This is where she gave me my nickname.

09:23.994 --> 09:25.754
Is there something funny?

09:25.894 --> 09:27.414
N-no.

09:35.774 --> 09:37.894
I don't get it at all!

09:39.904 --> 09:41.344
Go like this.

09:43.014 --> 09:44.014
Here!

09:44.014 --> 09:45.444
Thank you!

10:03.194 --> 10:08.464
Suddenly, from that day on, my nickname
in class was "Crispy Amino".

10:09.504 --> 10:11.134
Is that so?

10:37.064 --> 10:41.474
Every year they hold a fireworks show
around here. Did you know that?

10:41.474 --> 10:43.134
Uh, yes.

10:43.134 --> 10:46.734
Oh, you did? Are you from here?

10:56.254 --> 11:01.914
The last time they had the fireworks,
I searched all around this place.

11:08.834 --> 11:13.604
Lots of people turn up for it, so I thought
maybe lokawa would be there, too.

11:13.604 --> 11:16.734
I sneaked out of my house and searched, but...

11:17.704 --> 11:19.004
Did you have any luck?

11:19.374 --> 11:20.534
No.

11:21.714 --> 11:23.044
Oh.

12:28.014 --> 12:29.344
Made it!

12:44.994 --> 12:46.394
You okay?

12:47.494 --> 12:49.364
Yes, I...

12:49.664 --> 12:51.754
I'm... I'm fine.

13:09.484 --> 13:12.284
So, are you lokawa's brother's girlfriend?

13:12.284 --> 13:13.254
What?

13:14.194 --> 13:17.784
I mean, you're living together. Right?

13:18.124 --> 13:20.494
Yes, but...

13:20.764 --> 13:22.994
So, have you ever met lokawa?

13:23.864 --> 13:24.894
Yes...

13:27.504 --> 13:29.664
Why are you so worried about her?

13:30.744 --> 13:33.404
Is she that untrustworthy?

13:34.874 --> 13:36.464
That's not it at all.

13:38.384 --> 13:43.284
She's small, but she's a lot more
responsible than I am.

13:43.284 --> 13:45.084
Then why?

13:45.854 --> 13:48.384
I guess because I can't leave her on her own.

13:50.764 --> 13:54.284
She may be responsible, but she needs
a lot of work on some things.

13:55.164 --> 13:58.794
Sometimes, she'll suddenly do something
completely off-the-wall.

14:06.644 --> 14:08.074
Hey!

14:09.044 --> 14:10.204
Come this way!

14:21.094 --> 14:24.194
Um, you really want to go this way?

14:24.194 --> 14:25.384
Yeah.

14:35.534 --> 14:38.504
Have I maybe been here before?

14:38.704 --> 14:39.674
Huh?

14:41.914 --> 14:44.274
Uh, what I mean is...

14:45.114 --> 14:48.204
Have you been by here before, with that girl?

15:22.214 --> 15:23.484
C'mon, lokawa.

15:25.584 --> 15:27.184
Thank you very much.

15:36.364 --> 15:37.834
C'mon, lokawa.

16:02.054 --> 16:03.544
Oh...

16:18.274 --> 16:20.244
Looks like we can't get in.

16:30.154 --> 16:31.114
See?

17:18.534 --> 17:20.594
This is the river's source.

17:22.274 --> 17:25.774
A long time ago I traced the river back
and ended up here.

17:25.774 --> 17:27.404
Oh, really?

17:33.984 --> 17:35.174
It's cold.

17:35.754 --> 17:38.584
You remember that water at the shrine before?

17:39.324 --> 17:41.684
That's drawn from here, too.

17:48.634 --> 17:52.394
The truth is, there's no point
searching for her here.

17:53.004 --> 17:54.264
Is that so?

17:54.874 --> 17:57.334
I invited her to come with me before,

17:57.334 --> 18:01.294
but she got scared halfway and went back home.

18:07.444 --> 18:10.854
When that girl comes back,
please bring her here.

18:13.324 --> 18:15.554
I'm sure it will make her happy.

18:22.264 --> 18:23.284
Sure.

18:44.184 --> 18:45.714
Welcome back!

18:46.784 --> 18:48.314
Miss Shoko!

18:48.854 --> 18:51.184
You're late. We were worried about you.

18:52.064 --> 18:53.554
I'm back now!

18:59.704 --> 19:01.364
Where did you go?

19:02.804 --> 19:04.534
It's a secret.

19:11.244 --> 19:12.814
Miss Shoko?

19:12.814 --> 19:13.744
Yes?

19:14.344 --> 19:17.074
Um, this is just hypothetical...

19:18.384 --> 19:20.754
Say you get in a fight with your friend.

19:21.154 --> 19:22.484
You got in a fight?

19:22.924 --> 19:24.084
This is just hypothetical!

19:25.094 --> 19:31.764
What should you do when you want to make up
but can't quite say what you're really feeling?

19:32.234 --> 19:34.504
Why not just speak honestly?

19:34.504 --> 19:36.604
But the two friends can't meet.

19:36.604 --> 19:39.504
If they're that far apart, how about the phone?

19:40.674 --> 19:43.164
One of them lives in the mountains
with no phone.

19:45.744 --> 19:47.974
Then write a letter, I guess.

19:49.514 --> 19:51.454
A letter, huh?

20:09.534 --> 20:10.934
I'm home!

20:11.604 --> 20:14.104
Ugh, it's so hot!

20:14.104 --> 20:15.374
Welcome back.

20:16.214 --> 20:18.144
Hey, yeah.

20:18.144 --> 20:21.154
Didn't you say you were going to
lokawa's house or something?

20:21.154 --> 20:23.274
I went.

20:27.284 --> 20:30.954
Someone who seems like
lokawa's brother's girlfriend

20:30.954 --> 20:34.324
and some girl, a relative or something,
are living there now.

20:34.864 --> 20:38.324
Ah, I saw that girl the other day, too.

20:38.704 --> 20:42.104
That Hiro sure does like playing the field, eh?

20:42.334 --> 20:44.464
Yeah, I guess.

20:45.544 --> 20:46.734
Here.

20:48.544 --> 20:49.544
What's this?

20:49.544 --> 20:52.844
I went to return the yukata, and picked
that up at the house while I was there.

20:54.214 --> 20:56.444
No way, there's no beer?

21:03.924 --> 21:06.364
Karada
lokawa

21:10.634 --> 21:11.294
There we go!

21:12.704 --> 21:15.134
I bring you summer greetings!

21:15.604 --> 21:21.944
Amino, right now I'm spending some time
at my mother's relatives' house.

21:22.074 --> 21:24.914
It's hotter here than in Kanocho...

21:26.444 --> 21:29.214
It's hotter and... Hotter...

21:29.784 --> 21:30.754
Ah!

21:32.154 --> 21:35.284
And sometimes, it's like noon
when it's only morning!

21:35.424 --> 21:42.194
I study every morning, and in the afternoons
I read or go to the beach.

21:43.634 --> 21:45.804
What are you all grinning about?

21:45.804 --> 21:48.534
Aah, shut up. It's my right.

21:48.534 --> 21:51.664
If you're done with your errand,
feel free to go back to the house.

21:52.274 --> 21:55.004
What's wrong with me just stayin' here?!

22:13.964 --> 22:20.204
Narenai kutsu wo haita

22:20.204 --> 22:24.934
Ippozutsu taeru itami

22:26.374 --> 22:32.644
Soredemo aruku no wa

22:32.644 --> 22:37.444
Kaeru basho ga aru kara

22:38.224 --> 22:46.364
Watashi ga watashi wo mitsumete

22:46.364 --> 22:50.954
Kizuita wasuremono

22:54.104 --> 23:00.274
Anato to issho ni itai

23:00.274 --> 23:06.984
Chikaku de, tooku de kanjitai yo

23:06.984 --> 23:12.854
Atarimae no mainichi

23:12.854 --> 23:19.494
Itoshii anato to tsukuritsuzukeru

23:19.494 --> 23:26.924
"Tadaima" to kutsu wo nuide, dakishimeru

23:27.164 --> 23:32.004
My sweet home

23:43.554 --> 23:46.644
We spent that time together, just once.

23:47.284 --> 23:49.584
You hadn't remembered it...

23:49.894 --> 23:51.794
Nor did you seem happy.

23:52.524 --> 23:56.794
Since then, I may have tried
too hard somehow...

23:57.494 --> 24:00.994
And yet, I wanted you to be happy.

24:01.534 --> 24:03.294
A time spent together...

24:03.434 --> 24:05.304
Your birthday.

